e for this product. A UK voiceover was needed and I got the call. Conversational they requested.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2017-05-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"BBK travel Insurance Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A natural UK voiceover for the BBK travel Insurance explainer.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Another natural voice style</h2>\r\n<p>I'm very comfortable with this type of delivery. It's the one I'm asked for most of the time. Lets face it, the voiceover for an explainer video should carry the content along but not dominate it; it should sound conversational and appealing, whilst making the information as easy to process as possible. Hopefully, my extensive experience with <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video\">explainer video voiceover</a> is why I keep getting booked. It's nice to work with some new and interesting brands and it's also a pleasure when the end result has been mixed and mastered well too. Just like this.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E4qpxtFnwRQ","title":"BBK travel Insurance Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover.jpg","alt":"bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Who are BBK</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"/https://www.bbkonline.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BBK\">BBK's</a> motto is 'the Brighter way'. Whether you're an individual, a family, or as a business, they aim to help you fulfill a secure and brighter life. By leveraging our research, technology, and foresight they offer you superior products and services, to ensure a financially secure future. They provide you with an annual travel insurance policy designed to cover the whole family in one; it's designed to give you and your family peace of mind and comfort while you're out, exploring the World! BBK is a class act and they put a lot effort into producing what I think is a great explainer video (and I'd know as I've done a few dozen by this point!).</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Need a voice for your brand?</h2>\r\n<p>Trusted by global brands, let me help with your product video. If you need a little more convincing, watch my <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover show reel</a> or my <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video\">explainer video voiceover show rell</a>. What ever you need, lets chat. To make it easier for you, I'd love to send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for the brand or project you are working on. Just get in touch and tell me a little more about your brand and your project!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"BBK travel Insurance Voiceover","pageUrl":"bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","713",{"href":"/father-christmas-santa-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/father-christmas-santa-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Father Christmas Santa Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Father Christmas Santa Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","922",{"href":"/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice.jpg","alt":"boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Boom Beach Hammerman's hot tub"}]]}],["$","$L3","563",{"href":"/michael-caine-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/michael-caine-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Michael Caine Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Michael Caine Voiceover"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/913cecfa117908b5.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":[["$","head",null,{"children":[["$","link",null,{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico","sizes":"a